WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:19.688
Rat and Mole got the boat out.

2
00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:21.541
It was dark now.

3
00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:24.875
The moon shone on the water.

4
00:00:24.876 --> 00:00:28.545
Rat rowed them onto the river.

5
00:00:28.546 --> 00:00:33.472
"Our river looks so different at night," said Mole.

6
00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:37.214
"It looks like silver," sighed Rat.

7
00:00:37.215 --> 00:00:40.538
"I love my river at night."

8
00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:44.401
"Let's tie up here," said Mole.

9
00:00:44.402 --> 00:00:47.673
He pointed to a willow tree.

10
00:00:47.674 --> 00:00:52.473
"Yes, it's a good place to start looking," said Rat.

11
00:00:52.474 --> 00:00:56.413
The friends got out and searched.

12
00:00:56.414 --> 00:00:59.821
"Nothing here," said Mole.

13
00:00:59.822 --> 00:01:03.809
He looked in some hollow trees.

14
00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:07.202
"Nothing here," said Rat.

15
00:01:07.203 --> 00:01:09.881
He climbed out of a ditch.

16
00:01:09.882 --> 00:01:13.003
They got back in the boat.

17
00:01:13.004 --> 00:01:16.749
Mole paddled them down the river again.

18
00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.344
A gentle wind came up.

19
00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:25.940
It moved the reeds along the banks.

20
00:01:25.941 --> 00:01:31.603
Rat sat up and said, "What's that sound?"

21
00:01:31.604 --> 00:01:36.083
"It's only the wind in the reeds," said Mole.

22
00:01:36.084 --> 00:01:39.575
"It's music!" cried Rat.

23
00:01:39.576 --> 00:01:41.339
"Can't you hear it?"

24
00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:45.747
"No," said Mole.

25
00:01:45.748 --> 00:01:48.888
"It's gone," said Rat.

26
00:01:48.889 --> 00:01:51.802
"It was so beautiful.

27
00:01:51.803 --> 00:01:55.773
It was like a song and a dream."

28
00:01:55.774 --> 00:01:58.802
"I didn't hear anything," said Mole.

29
00:01:58.803 --> 00:02:01.802
"Oh!" said Rat.

30
00:02:01.803 --> 00:02:05.076
"I've never heard such music!"

31
00:02:05.077 --> 00:02:09.275
"It's just the wind in the reeds," said Mole.

32
00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:11.670
"It's the wind in the willows."

33
00:02:11.671 --> 00:02:16.401
"The music is calling us, Mole!" cried Rat.

34
00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.981
"We must follow it!"
